1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,420
Anyone can make a certificate look real.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,203
A PDF can be edited.

3
00:00:06,203 --> 00:00:08,224
A screenshot can be faked.

4
00:00:08,224 --> 00:00:10,300
And a real check can take days.

5
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:14,782
So employers and programs either wait, or skip the check.

6
00:00:14,782 --> 00:00:16,270
And the people who actually earned

7
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:18,290
something have no portable proof.

8
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:23,210
We're the team behind Credentia, built for Monad Metropolis.

9
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:29,329
We're building it because checking a credential should take seconds, not days,

10
00:00:29,329 --> 00:00:33,180
and because proof should belong to the person who earned it.

11
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:37,979
Credentia anchors a fingerprint of a credential on Monad.

12
00:00:37,979 --> 00:00:41,233
Open the link, and the check runs against the chain.

13
00:00:41,233 --> 00:00:42,256
No account.

14
00:00:42,256 --> 00:00:43,040
No wallet.

15
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:46,333
It's for hackathons, bootcamps, employers,

16
00:00:46,333 --> 00:00:50,570
and anyone who's ever had to take a certificate on trust.

17
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:54,488
Here's a real credential on Monad testnet.

18
00:00:54,488 --> 00:00:55,380
Verified.

19
00:00:56,110 --> 00:00:58,230
Now change one detail in the link.

20
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:03,700
The fingerprint no longer matches, and Credentia says so.

21
00:01:04,430 --> 00:01:06,773
And when an issuer withdraws a credential,

22
00:01:06,773 --> 00:01:08,280
the page says revoked.

23
00:01:09,010 --> 00:01:15,167
Real transactions on Monad testnet, 178 contract tests, 242 web tests,

24
00:01:15,167 --> 00:01:19,220
and a backtest with five people.

25
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:22,290
It's live on Monad testnet today.

26
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,505
Next: a real identity check for issuers,

27
00:01:25,505 --> 00:01:28,200
private selective disclosure, and mainnet.

28
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,376
Credentia.

29
00:01:31,376 --> 00:01:33,176
Don't trust the claim.

30
00:01:33,176 --> 00:01:34,690
Verify the credential.
